    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "C4780CFDD2B29596",
      "text": "It feels like just yesterday that you were here for\\nyour Gym Test.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "C4780BFDD2B293E3",
      "text": "Now you’re all Championed up and out doin’\\nerrands for La Primera herself![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "C4780AFDD2B29230",
      "text": "Tell ya somethin’: You get to be my age?\\nTime starts passin’ you by fast.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "C47811FDD2B29E15",
      "text": "But that sentimental style’s not worth my while!\\nTime to kick a rhyme and hit the flow—let’s go![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "C47810FDD2B29C62",
      "text": "My spirit’s burnin’—yearnin’ to get this battle\\nchurnin’! You best be ready to begin![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "C4780FFDD2B29AAF",
      "text": "Our little Champion is comin’ into h[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]iser own...[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "C4780EFDD2B298FC",
      "text": "Come on, baby! Rattle me down to the bone![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "C47815FDD2B2A4E1",
      "text": "Hahaha! Wasn’t expectin’ you to rattle me\\nTHAT much![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "C47814FDD2B2A32E",
      "text": "You caught me off guard just like Shadow Sneak![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "C47487FDD2AF7DC0",
      "text": "Sorry for callin’ you a rookie. Hope we’re good.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_11",
      "hash64": "C47488FDD2AF7F73",
      "text": "I just wanted to prove the strength of Ghost\\ntypes to Geeta, but I guess I got carried away.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_12",
      "hash64": "C47489FDD2AF8126",
      "text": "You’re the real deal, my friend. I can guarantee\\nthat.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_13",
      "hash64": "C4748AFDD2AF82D9",
      "text": "From here on out, Ryme’s got your back.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_14",
      "hash64": "C4748BFDD2AF848C",
      "text": "If you run into any vexin’ Trainers or hexin’\\nspecters, you just give me a call.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_15",
      "hash64": "C4748CFDD2AF863F",
      "text": "Now you go enjoy this big, wide world to the\\nfullest, you hear me? Later, baby![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
